  "synopsis": [
    {
      "langue": "en",
      "text": "T*Gun is a NES shmup released this year and only distributed at the gaming convention TooManyGames in extremely limited quantities.\r\n\r\nIn this NES homebrew game, two robot birds fly through space shooting down giant insects in an attempt to rescue a strange planet. You gather attack bits that follow you and power up your shot."
